Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(谁是老大)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚检查完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just finishing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是阴性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在习惯做我自己的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still getting used to being my own assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:11.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他们说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they say...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-照做就行  -我说了别跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- just do it. - ‭I said don't talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:27.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会好转的  如果你配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll get better -- if you let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根会照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan will take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwighty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟我的朋友聊会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to my associate for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去做你的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go about your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你站在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, stand right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我渐渐知道怎么用这玩意儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm getting the hang of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.74,0:10:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你的下场  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你放聪明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以跟他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be like them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者跟它们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少受点罪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it easy on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't ever gonna kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这样说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I said that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}...that's the thing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:10:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is going ape-shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你呢  你在火上浇油\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you? You are hustling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然见效很慢  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working slow, but, hey, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人就是更难击溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}some people are harder to break than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你做得这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're doing such an awesome job,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.85,0:12:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟之前的老熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to have a little blast from the past
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩一玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you-know-who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开玩笑的  放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding, man. Lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想选谁都行  只要她愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick whoever you want, as long as she says yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下面还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的老二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your penis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙  他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that guy, he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:27.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狠狠咬了一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}clomped on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会不会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经萎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}down for the count? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:44.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你真的"好"吗  德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you cool, though, Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚可是说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I just said
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小妞任选  供君消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was happy hour at the Pussy Bar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特可以免费享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dwight eats for free,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你却告诉我说"不用了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're telling me no?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫"好"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作还没完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't finished the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还不配得到奖赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I haven't earned it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:03.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么屁话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,付出就有收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}You earn what you take.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.54,0:13:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现橙色事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an orange situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉特  什么情况  有人偷东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arat, what do you got? Grab-a-go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  他只能从三条路逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he could've only gone three ways --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛾子那条 天使那条  或者难走的那条\N{\fnArial\fs30}the moth, the angel, or the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小德  我在门口和你汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's D. I'll meet you at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想拿回我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I want my shit back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那是件苦差事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is grunt work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如让肥乔去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have Fat Joey go and do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:35.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他绝对需要多运动运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows he needs the exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用去的  德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do it, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁着还能回去  赶紧回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我就回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论他对你做了什么  都还能更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he's done to you, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你被抓回来了  惩罚会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're back, it'll be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓尿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we pissing our pants yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:55.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:19:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用这次逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this was your shot to prove to me that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明了这个简单的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}that fundamental fact was sinking in,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which sucks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的生活本可以变得好很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}because your life was about to get so much cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特给了你一些选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dwight gave you some options.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你没搞明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you get it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就细说给你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna break it down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有三个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get three choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一  你被插在柱子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, you wind up on the spike
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为死人替我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you work for me as a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二  你从牢里出来  靠工作赚工分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, you get out of your cell, you work for points,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你会生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're gonna wish you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者第三  你为我效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or three, you work for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给自己弄一双新鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get yourself a brand-new pair of shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活得像国王一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you live like a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这选择似乎很明显嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choice seems pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道  没有第四种选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know, there is no door number four.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是唯一的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难吓到你嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't scare easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lucille...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很生气哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it kind of pisses her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她觉得你这样很不敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}She finds it to be disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:22:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她今天不是很口渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's not feeling too thirsty today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我很口渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去喝一杯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get me a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多事  我真希望我永远都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many things I wish I never found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我没有试图...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I didn't try...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.59,0:23:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前在森林里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the woods...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.64,0:24:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我失去蒂娜之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I lost Tina...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿了你的东西  然后决定回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we took your stuff, when we decided to go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.35,0:24:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说了抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时说  "你会后悔的"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said, "You're gonna be."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.19,0:24:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我后悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.69,0:24:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.13,0:24:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的摩托废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bike's screwed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:36.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须回去  因为你欠着债\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're going back because you owe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.68,0:24:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你欠的债更多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you owe a hell of a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这值得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.97,0:24:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:51.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.19,0:24:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:00.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.86,0:25:07.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他做了那些事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything he did...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你  对你的妻子所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you, to your wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.91,0:25:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别提到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.53,0:25:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.06,0:25:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看  你无处可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都是他的  早晚都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's his or will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.96,0:25:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said keep walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.17,0:25:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.58,0:25:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开枪也不要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay if you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.28,0:25:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.27,0:25:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我希望你打死我  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I want you to. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.09,0:25:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.31,0:25:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为没别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.50,0:25:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是他的一面之词\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's what he tells us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.72,0:26:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说没别的选择  只能按他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there's no choice, no way but his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.99,0:26:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个拿着球棒邪笑的恶棍来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thug swoops in with a baseball bat and a smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.09,0:26:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们那么恐惧  放弃了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're all so scared that we gave up everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是一个人  我们有这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's only one of him and all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.07,0:26:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们要这样活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why are we living like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.36,0:26:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为看看我们现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because look where we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.59,0:26:18.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前一直在输\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.89,0:26:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和玛利亚死里逃生的最初几个月...\N{\fnArial\fs30}after me and Maria survived those first few months...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.59,0:26:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们到了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we got there...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.37,0:26:36.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为一切会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we thought it would be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.56,0:26:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为自己知道该怎么和怪物抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we knew how to fight the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.96,0:26:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.72,0:26:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的  小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.04,0:26:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里没有任何值得我留恋的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing back there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我今生最后一次下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last time I'm going to kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.27,0:27:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你懂的  -起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You feel. - ‭Get up...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.43,0:27:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得  小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就把你认识的所有人都丢进栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or I'll put every person you ever talked to on the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.84,0:27:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会蒙住他们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll blindfold them,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后逼他们在短暂又可悲的余生中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll make them eat shit sandwiches
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.83,0:27:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃大便三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the rest of their short, sorry lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:28.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你妻子的尸体挖出来喂乌鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll dig up your dead wife and feed her body to the crows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.57,0:27:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.57,0:27:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.43,0:27:33.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.92,0:27:39.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道  我生无可恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know there's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.02,0:29:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我一支吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.33,0:29:35.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.32,0:29:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:43.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.30,0:29:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:49.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.08,0:29:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.19,0:29:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比死强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hell of a lot better than being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.29,0:30:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.25,0:31:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.74,0:31:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你害死了你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your friend killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:14.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我害死了蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Tina killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.37,0:31:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装作你不了解真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't pretend like you don't know the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.57,0:31:30.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是尼根看中了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Negan's taken a shine to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.67,0:31:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘记这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.87,0:31:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你胃口好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.08,0:34:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.09,0:34:32.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.68,0:34:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.42,0:34:38.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.69,0:34:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.56,0:34:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会让卡森治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have Carson fix you all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.78,0:34:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你渴吗  给\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thirsty? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.10,0:34:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, hell, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.65,0:34:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mouth is all...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.42,0:34:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肿得像狒狒的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}puffed up like a baboon's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要吸管吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a straw?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.25,0:34:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德  给他根吸管\N{\fnArial\fs30}D, give him a straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.79,0:35:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么待客的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.11,0:35:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到那家伙了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.52,0:35:07.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他负责煽风点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hustles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.64,0:35:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢煽风点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.85,0:35:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是信不信由你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.45,0:35:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前并不和睦\N{\fnArial\fs30}things weren't always cool between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.74,0:35:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德  他要靠工作赚工分\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, D here -- he worked for points,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:28.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和他性感的妻子  还有她性感的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}him and his super hot wife and her super hot sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.83,0:35:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是妹妹  她需要药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see, sis -- she needed meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意儿很难搜集\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that shit is hard to scavenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.61,0:35:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以价值更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it cost more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.90,0:35:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹没赚够工分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sis fell behind on points,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.89,0:35:41.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我让她嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I asked her to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.90,0:35:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说我会照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her I would take care of her
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.05,0:35:47.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论生老病死  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}in sickness and in health, blah blah blah, 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.19,0:35:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是个顶天立地的男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am a stand-up guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.16,0:35:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉我她会想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tells me that she's gonna think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.82,0:35:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.11,0:36:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就出了橙色事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dealing with an orange situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.00,0:36:04.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德怀特偷走了所有的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwighty boy here stole all the medication
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.82,0:36:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带上了他性感的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took off with his super hot wife
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.10,0:36:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我性感的准未婚妻跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my super hot maybe soon-to-be fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.81,0:36:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我必须派人去追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I had to send my guys after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.93,0:36:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不能容忍这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can't let something like that stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.86,0:36:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是有规矩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There...are...rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.74,0:36:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追他让我付出了很大代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cost me an arm and a leg going after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.02,0:36:34.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎么着  小德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what -- Dwighty boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.17,0:36:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.90,0:36:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.34,0:36:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德  他觉悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}D -- he saw the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.01,0:36:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他拿出了男子气概  他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He manned up. He came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.98,0:36:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他求我原谅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for my forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.10,0:36:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.93,0:36:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我眼前一亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made me... take notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.01,0:37:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lucille...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.29,0:37:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...you know how she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.26,0:37:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a stickler for the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dwight...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.47,0:37:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他求我别杀雪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}...he begged me not to kill Sherry,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.96,0:37:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得还挺可爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I thought was kind of cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.49,0:37:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我只打算杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I was just gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.67,0:37:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是然后雪莉说她会嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then Sherry says that she will marry me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.32,0:37:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我让德怀特活命的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I let Dwight live,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.15,0:37:31.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细想想  这提议还挺变态的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, if you think about it, that's a pretty screwed-up deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.60,0:37:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我本来要娶的是她妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I was gonna marry her sister
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果她死了  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}until she wound up dead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.47,0:37:39.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪莉的确非常性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherry is super hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.64,0:37:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之  这是个好开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, it was a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.38,0:37:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.61,0:37:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Dwight...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.53,0:37:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受了烙铁之刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}he got the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.66,0:37:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我娶了他性感的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I married his super hot wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.65,0:37:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex-wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了这些事  他依然入伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after all that, he still got on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.56,0:38:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.23,0:38:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最得力的手下之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my top guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.57,0:38:14.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们完全和好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are totally cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.45,0:38:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point being,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.93,0:38:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你也能成为那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you can be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you are ready to be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.44,0:38:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.12,0:38:28.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.37,0:38:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都可以归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... it can all be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.78,0:38:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用做的只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to do is 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.91,0:38:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答一个简单问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}answer one simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.44,0:38:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.60,0:38:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不出话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, does the cat got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.83,0:38:55.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被这壮丽的景象惊呆了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just overwhelmed by the awesomeness of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.72,0:38:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.33,0:39:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.37,0:39:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.14,0:39:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是唯一的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is the only...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.44,0:39:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sst, sst, sst.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.77,0:39:47.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.86,0:39:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做出了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.65,0:39:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做出愚蠢的选择不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't my problem if he made a dumbass choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.76,0:40:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么进那个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wind up in that room
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.23,0:40:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么挂在栅栏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}or hanging on the fence!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.39,0:40:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解你为什么那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.68,0:40:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.13,0:40:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为别人着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were thinking about someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.53,0:40:40.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我不能接受的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
